[00:40.41]China has become particularly active in the economy,
[00:44.05]which leads to the increasing demand for qualified accountants.
[00:48.73]In addition,
[00:49.86]the development of the job market on the whole cannot 
[00:53.86]keep pace with the expansion of college graduates,
